{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"春宜理气 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"春夏治法：论春宜理气 夏宜健脾","date_published":"2026-06-10T13:02:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-06-10T13:05:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/4-24-chunxiazhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/4-24-chunxiazhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["春夏治法","春宜理气","夏宜健脾"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“春夏治法”部分，专论春季与夏季因时制宜的调治法则。核心思想是：春宜疏泄理气以养肝，夏宜清凉健脾以润肺祛暑，随春夏发生之气而治之得法。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“春夏治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e春季与夏季\u003c/strong\u003e因时制宜的调治法则。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e春宜疏泄理气以养肝，夏宜清凉健脾以润肺祛暑，随春夏发生之气而治之得法\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}